  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Finance Flows Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Forest Finance Flows Initiative will address the financial sectors impact on forest and land related emissions through a two pronged approach connecting investors with investable projects through the Forest Investor Club and improving financial sector transparency, policies, systems and regulations.</narrative>
